OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEleanor Donaldson given
OL,4,Asupervision order and placed on sex
OL,5,Aoffenders' register
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Judge Paul Ramsey asked if she
OL,8,Funderstood that she would be subjected
OL,9,Fto a supervision treatment order (STO),
OL,10,Fshe nodded her head and said "yes".
OL,12,FEleanor Donaldson could not be given a
OL,13,Fprison sentence as she faced a 'trial
OL,14,Fof the facts' as it was determined she
OL,15,Fwas medically unfit for a criminal
OL,16,Ftrial.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
